      <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230' }}>先修报告约定，再谈方法优劣。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 360, marginTop: 16, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 370, height: 360, borderTop: '3px solid #1E4FA8', background: '#F7F9FC', padding: 20, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>局限</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 16 }}>· 两个基准都是仿真，无真实传感器数据</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 14 }}>· 50% 档全部落在 0.34–0.66，排序不稳</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 14 }}>· 真实轴承数据只有 15 / 17 台，达不到 143 台/箱</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 14 }}>· 检测门槛依赖分箱与 Bonferroni 假设</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8', lineHeight: 1.45, marginTop: 18 }}>这些限制不隐藏，已写进论文 Limitations。</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ width: 370, height: 360, borderTop: '3px solid #1E4FA8', background: '#F7F9FC', padding: 20, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>下一步</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 16 }}>· 投 TIM：7 页测量学短文，已编译</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 14 }}>· B 线：RID 已否证；CAI 训练中，汇总未出</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 14 }}>· 复现包：17 个脚本、21 个 JSON、一条命令重跑</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 14 }}>· 把四条报告规范写成 checklist</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8', lineHeight: 1.45, marginTop: 18 }}>B 线结果出来之前，不写成结论。</Text>
